pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>METHODOLOGY</p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 65, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>The Attention A/B: Isolating What Matters</strong></p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$midGray"
  - elementId: figure
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 130, 700, 380]
    src: "D:/AI_Models/quant-alpha-foundation/paper/presentation/images/isolation_anchors.png"
    fit:
      mode: contain
  - elementId: right-label-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [790, 140, 430, 5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: right-text-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [790, 155, 430, 95]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Island anchor</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px">Equal-weight composite of input alphas. No propagation. The baseline.</p>
  - elementId: right-label-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [790, 265, 430, 5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$secondary"
  - elementId: right-text-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [790, 280, 430, 95]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Uniform anchor</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px">Same composite averaged uniformly over the graph topology. Relational but unlearned.</p>
  - elementId: right-label-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [790, 390, 430, 5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: right-text-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [790, 405, 430, 95]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>GAT</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px">Learned attention over the same topology. The thing we are testing.</p>
  - elementId: insight-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 530, 1160, 60]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: insight-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 535, 1120, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Attention value-add</strong> = GAT OOS Sharpe − Uniform-anchor OOS Sharpe. Same inputs, same topology, same harness.</p>
  - elementId: formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 610, 1160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$darkGray"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Graph contribution = island vs uniform  |  Learned attention contribution = uniform vs GAT</p>
  - elementId: footer-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 680, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 685, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Relational Alpha Factors · GAT Capstone</p>
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 685, 120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>5</p>
